flowchart TB

    A[User]

    A --> B[Login Request]

    B --> C[API Gateway]

    C --> D[Authentication Controller]

    D --> E[Validate Request]

    E --> F{Valid Input?}

    F -->|No| G[Return Validation Error]

    F -->|Yes| H[User Service]

    H --> I[(MySQL Database)]

    I --> J[Fetch User]

    J --> K{User Exists?}

    K -->|No| L[Return Invalid Credentials]

    K -->|Yes| M[Verify Password Hash]

    M --> N{Password Match?}

    N -->|No| O[Return Invalid Credentials]

    N -->|Yes| P[Generate JWT Access Token]

    P --> Q[Generate Refresh Token]

    Q --> R[(Redis Session Store)]

    R --> S[Store Refresh Token]

    S --> T[Build Auth Response]

    T --> U[Return Access Token]

    U --> V[Client Stores Token]

    V --> W[Authenticated Requests]

    W --> X[Authorization Middleware]

    X --> Y[Verify JWT]

    Y --> Z{Token Valid?}

    Z -->|No| AA[401 Unauthorized]

    Z -->|Yes| AB[Allow Access]

    subgraph Authentication_Process
        D
        E
        H
        M
        P
        Q
    end

    subgraph Storage
        I
        R
    end

    subgraph Protected_APIs
        X
        Y
        AB
    end